{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1472,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c638f9f5733479fae0ab6dcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "点心时间是宣传蓝靛果的好机会！\r\n我要去把使用了蓝靛果果酱的\r\n超美味点心发给大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56902fe406829b8edeb52c5c3cb1bc0af45d056cb132d5e2b5df42e0bcaea477",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8310878121a04bc490f3c1fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "苫小好～☆……用这种方式打招呼\r\n好像还不错。训练员，苫小好～☆\r\n……你觉得怎么样！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc65fc35407612177d9951609b92ee7773b70aa8e2cb5495e14c6386de87cefc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24dfe2b4b8d8f49662fa03a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果要贯彻纯朴风格……果然还是要\r\n主打方言……啊，不好意思！\r\n我正在思索未来的活动方向。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e93f80a2a6c43ea8d766e38d19add8c6b3476f28909f90b2a24e50032ada73d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:902c4814514be979d32b2530",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚安……晚安安☆侬是火山☆\r\n……这样与其说是地方偶像，\r\n更像是搞笑艺人呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cafa3910f385449e85b1f34ad8f7c28e473ebbe4aa901ded0fc492331245515f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a2b36fa102331e6457b0d65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天到了……替服装加上一点\r\n樱花要素，强调出青涩的感觉……\r\n嗯，或许可行呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f1f059c38c57c102db16f800d20dddfacd55ef1c2d4fd4e39f76aa1417de158",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e5caccb871fd74568d8e799",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气热到让人受不了……\r\n这时候就要吃营养丰富的蓝靛果！\r\n最棒的是！现在正好是产季！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfefa14a432e1873162b2bc472d518f73261a99f166ae00c7d8410dd75012064",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:653573c6f33c2accd6a9c841",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鲑鱼、花鱼、北寄贝……\r\n还有其他很多美食。食欲之秋\r\n有太多让人想推荐的东西了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "972bc056dbce178e95ebccbb976f0321eb81e0a638b2b0a67660448a56c79ba6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:892c9d1df832c7b9361279eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又到这个季节了。\r\n我要用在故乡磨练出的冰舞技巧，\r\n来宣传苫小牧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c19c39df066155c479406748351d6a6d26667f19ca8e59792d9e3e3d5ce1059",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e72e61bb08555c44d3f16ae2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晒黑是地方偶像的大敌！\n和季节无关，\n从早上开始就得做好预防。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0db79f797a33fe164addfa8ca8cce5ede3b6135c55b85dbccb594a8ddaf052fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29cc4225b7e25f3b19ee46fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在家乡港口看到的朝阳，\n真令人难忘啊……\n有机会的话想让训练员也看看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0dcf235e2729b8b22d20ddca906f9f6747b208ed186c33594813d4ab93088df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c15fadb50f124853edb600bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我做到了！虽然是期间限定，\n但食堂总算能提供苫小牧午餐了……\n提了这个建议真是太好了~",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b28d777bc37916dda6116616325a80a2ac104cfa2c1519cfdac92fccf35c34e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b197f4102a6764fd3713b56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希城前辈问我\n『没有蓝靛果味的棒棒糖吗？』\n没想到她会对这个感兴趣……欸嘿嘿",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa1c1d97e705062d30b4538aba84c562e9dc6991702ee8a9e35cec6227da34a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf2e8ebeb7c26c6de4dfc81f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "睡前的皮肤护理，\n用蓝靛果配合美容液就很完美♪\n训练员要试试看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "52a446c4e299cf5a51dbaa7464a66ea1be3f65fd217e3134360117ecc5087665",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f21d4f5f3d07cba787d8562",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "幽灵什么的是迷信，不可能有\n这种东西。可是……嗯~\n训练员请绝对不要给我讲什么怪谈哦",
      "source_fingerprint": "b063b6a1ddca13221707725e55c761925ef3c8033abe7a445f3594ac5c22a063",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:654d03d704e6e259a198a980",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天是萌芽的季节，鼓起干劲\n倍积贝力哒呗！……怎么样？这个\n和苫小牧有关的口号，有说法的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfcb2d3de6996f34d2aae07500eac413d11ff7047045064a6302010f1694a7c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44f1cd5e11864000dd134595",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是夏天哦，夏天！美食活动\n还有音乐节！作为地方偶像，\n我会全力以赴哒呗~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8638f6794f2e35660502973e8300a8bd3c0555ba917e72e0bd89387ed8fdd61f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82bac5774e7de5fe3d3148fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "狂怒乐章同学送了我\n正当时令的本地菠菜！\n这样的交流，还想再多一些呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a5e5fef550ad746bb54a54f35de8fd6f1daf844a32dec3cc56209d27beddd90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bfec7e13c402260d1fc7d3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天时Utonai湖会结霜花哦。\n那幅景象很梦幻……\n梦幻到能让人忘记寒冷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52c982fc3455eb77c297f8dd84de299ba5ab6bac4419f110552b3810426fae88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fc479a08eebdb41f4c191e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情、情人节快乐……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a4ecac6e4cb1423c2c2f0e9d42742f072f896916443e39dddca13906138ae6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18e0df6a95f6965aab878792",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情、情人节快乐……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a4ecac6e4cb1423c2c2f0e9d42742f072f896916443e39dddca13906138ae6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6821fede031b35d6a5c0bbdb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我试着做了蓝靛果甜点，\r\n然后拜托闪耀帮忙评鉴。\r\n目标是做出能让专家认同的味道！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0954bdd24937113884fd79b4443af9c0738218bf945fc647a7037f83fa8d7ee9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fec43193e1e1932fba3942db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子在演唱会上一和我对上视线，\r\n就立刻朝我眨眼……\r\n让我心动了一下。她果然厉害……",
      "source_fingerprint": "62945fff27b0f60e48c3a2d7d7daeb7be8333aba83f6d298ea4854881ad3674c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc6f39b79c79b56e59073390",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锐骏做的腌萝卜非常好吃。\r\n下次跟她喝茶的时候，\r\n我要带苫小牧的著名点心过去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "276dcfc7649dab5cb1de1006b76242c7b5b6144018354e31894e1f31f0adb92b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4847993232fe34f22228cc91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和历奇一起去卡拉OK后，\r\n发现她很会助兴。明明只有我们\r\n两个人，感觉却像在开演唱会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "935635b84c77f4ff3f844fcbfc06943c1ee96e7babb9eb9bc33c8fb49165a0fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1670d4937203477e08dab86b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实我的兴趣是登山。\r\n因为这个缘故，我曾经帮樽前山\r\n附近的露营场宣传过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "492d3d8df68654fb2eb6dcd0eb48d4785f19bcbe99d30cca3e2882c3f22fdae4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d0fa2a5d5c4aa9acf8fae05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唱情歌时可以走可爱风格，\r\n但唱摇滚乐时该走什么方向呢……\r\n嗯～真是困难。",
      "source_fingerprint": "944a76e06876f1b918141f381f2b913d678580cea07e38021c1bb149c8b20453",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b877c70efdab119e4f8ccf3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服现在这样已经很棒了……\r\n但如果把钮扣做成北寄贝的样子\r\n会更棒……不、不行吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d92b94c09cf4523ee0a4ff80614fa754013a2d208131f19b8badc27f68810d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e3f1b1ca90362a999d34ce5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿上这件衣服，我就会回想起\r\n刚成为地方偶像时的记忆……\r\n当时发生过很多事呢……非常多……",
      "source_fingerprint": "62aac165990bcc10f9971b036b406a99c9a4ee82082a31a5014f60aff84e5325",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0eafb383ea15240f9bdb80fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我胸前缎带的造型是花菖蒲。\r\n就如同这花的花语，\r\n我想为苫小牧带来「好消息」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a20fb84844ee233ce9572650d337b21573088182e066f572de2459dba08522b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc374908423a17803294a63d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也是辛苦的一天馁～\r\n但还是要打起精神加油呗～☆\r\n……嗯，刚才的感觉还不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42479bdb582ca1d0486cfd01464d0928659b7e6f574f8c90c55edf3de1b6e7be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a2637c7e11e912bb25991ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我提议要在食堂举办苫小牧展。\r\n为了实现这个目标，\r\n我正在构思午餐的菜单。",
      "source_fingerprint": "742345fe13157459523a8007e8d433a388d544dd4606c76843bd3e3fb06ee632",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:628ffc1f0a14e5a1027a1cdb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也是为了苫小牧，\n我一定要好好赢下来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0034fd5b5f21b332c17b9a4e792aba4ccfa10c620a37107b7b208b9d8fbc04d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81a7118b6c18daf686bb7310",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不仰望夜空就不会发现闪耀的星星。\r\n苫小牧也须要先让大家\r\n注意到它的光辉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f468ba3c0db5d3932c8eec11d86dd5c3b3d057b8105904b064a88fa1967b469c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f758ed646a3d757abc520f3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我曾经和本地的吉祥物\r\n一起主持赏花活动。\r\n只要搜寻就能找到照片喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8ee1e919f22c0c9cf500e9e98962a0741d10b0ed30aaa5b7b7e710371d9b975",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b821fb619771290a4328d6ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每年到了夏日祭典的期间，我常会\r\n收到其他城市的邀情。但我基本上\r\n都是自己过去……很辛苦呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b71ea3d187bf6fdf09d7c9e28cfaeb4826e2565545782103479c185c77b14c24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29edba841316d9d386612bbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一到秋天，美食评论的工作就会\r\n变多。但我有时会凭着赛马娘的\r\n食量，一不小心就吃太多了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bbd1b0714724ea25ec5c983eedc80592a3dc214776cfb489d16f950761fa69e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffdb06edafe47dd55ee8d1e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我以前曾经在札幌的活动演出过，\r\n那里的雪多到让我吓了一跳。\r\n因为苫小牧的雪比较少。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc24bec3960c258ebab235c7b7e3bdba43a216d67aa2bf69805ff8e6f26b232d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ab16b8b452cf4bfadccabdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "历奇她啊，连去海边\n都要带着风水道具呢！\n……要是弄丢了哭鼻子我可不会管。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d012a57296b52a2a78744c1029727d822dfbcc8a1e814fa67f84aff209a053d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f87a05596c1dff952153ac7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和锐骏一起去赶海\n总是能大丰收呢。凭着那份专注\n一点点地……真不愧是她啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc23a587a8032212f256a7c585d5e1be187b269f7f070a73c5ba2bc56e060d31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75f85b213469251940569716",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子真的很厉害啊。\n哪怕在烈日下演出也能\n一直保持笑容…我也得向她学习！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d604bc418fe332419cd351674cc5f70006526fd715f0f00df42fb86ab5eb6360",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4904165ce3c673a476869144",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "极峰的度假照片全都好闪耀……！\n酒店、食物、交通工具……\n还有照片里的人都在闪闪发光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dbe5b10c381914b52c05e1a9c084e2315b59fb01e35c2c3729c7daad3b21911",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ad04d18bba40bf3b8d3717b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在定期游轮上办Live是我的梦想。\n因为晕船还只是个遥远的梦想……\n但总有一天一定会做到的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b7a5d89cc4eb3352ed09b69abbeacce91983f4909b18e25793e4ae2c3149abc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d3af7155a1a199e52eb3807",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蓝、蓝、蓝靛果~♪\n……这是很好的发声练习哦。\n要一起吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "55b8cd0d699bbce7075491413b1249783cf28b3a6d7bfdf527d5bd51eb9d7f21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:982023cf869b8f3df60d88ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天中午要做烧烤。\n黄油烤北寄贝，\n我会好好宣传一番的哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d37f7b447aa5f78f54d3e0366ad9bb8c790c63b1ae87b3583c851252524d12a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e850ae0097e935944449c467",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "创升会给我发『地区振兴参考案例』\n这类的邮件！……但都是在深夜发\n她都是几点睡觉呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d49c4da02eeed66ee404772778650f8f01df20a25ee83287c7159b8f7a5b49f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbdad885c614708039e9284c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要赏花的话，交给我这个\n地方偶像吧！热闹又开心的歌曲\n还有交谈也会像花一样盛开哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d9c8a58d492833e71ee72727791bb749a602e2de09101baffbe74cb740a5d76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f635da2e01464a9a8fdc6205",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热啊……但我不会偷懒的哦。\n我想，正是这种时候才能拉开差距。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4656624508b1b9e07c11a1e8a0e0799f9aa574e18da482589ace74b540cf08a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ee8d95adc31608bda9e50b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋鲑鱼的季节到了呢。我可是把它\n当成榜样的！哪怕洄游一圈两圈\n也要让自己成长起来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16cd535e0dd35146d31649dda5d6fa84b4e683fc4b7e44698e09834d97f8fb3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:624db523173922ab1936b605",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜，就算是我也觉得好冷……\n这身穿着的话，\n就这么跳进温泉也可以吧……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b5e1e446fbe08e176a8dde2bf68f944063ed45fc5aa2fbe9ca997eaba2801bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d4ba7367d3451b02a8cb3d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次休息要试试带着度假的心情\n悠闲度过吗？训练员也偶尔\n让自己的翅膀休息一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d617ab00234075edef723987362c1160c42c7198e7093051e64caa137d99113",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7fe7e570950af1340fad9ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在玉米地里微笑，\n戴着草帽的地方偶像……\n好，下一个PV就这么定了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9091262ea758f3a91e12f7c54c29569c4de1b35e0921073bdbb7a6a3dfb6379",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2ca6028f57ee4233def5a86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望我的表现，\r\n能为苫小牧的大家带来勇气……\r\n今天也请多指教了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "546d60cc5079675dc4f823882675e5adec52bba1c6fead0ac06db87954eeee21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad89dd62c4bfc1bec2371b63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37856990395c2e8d2f93741c5d35fcb43678531f679cbab98ac4667a82bdf516",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e06609e7cdf077c75eac5c72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要我绽放光芒，\r\n大家就会注意到苫小牧的光辉……\r\n我会怀着这样的信念努力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dce7d512063ee0dec0000089e2b7e042104bede5157bba5496a20288bb958f23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:517d16a94991d48476948d43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我花了三十分钟以上的时间做\r\n伸展运动，心跳也已经变快了！\r\n随时都可以开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "755cba8dedbdcb66308576ffaf15bbc250691bfc4efc9ab34ce64f2660750929",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d26e9d1ef3fe1f8c50b8899b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须锻炼出坚强的实力……！\r\n没错，就像凝聚了丰富鲜味的\r\n当季北寄贝一样……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "47f33af6fbaa816f5b8e36e9125e81afc099357c626e3bc311fc4c8a723dcc12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10fa58d0aa727e5cf2171bff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了故乡，我希望尽我所能，\r\n把能做的事情全都做完……\r\n请你助我一臂之力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66ad01f27200e0337de4d950c7d9f74c23f04eb9466a4f5a10888e72a5cb7106",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05bf8a55a425f9cf964e37b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能遇见如此为我和苫小牧\r\n着想的人……真的是太好了。\r\n我由衷地这么觉得。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49f10877d3ead3a5d3d3e8d2d7f361600744ae2900a7a8e8e337861c46e0baea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e4a44d4a551b1f6cc7124c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "同心协力发扬苫小牧──\r\n如果有天能实现这个愿望……那个、\r\n你愿意跟我一起参加故乡的活动吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "da1c9511f95a9a9a1da56f3036260798073e6a75a0a3783b2605fed685b8322b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30e99a4ba3232d68c39851c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这里让我想起了故乡的海岸呢……\r\n我越来越有干劲了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ab2bf7b138b86fc0590d6446c7b154ed2433ed67a17afc9f06588be4d57a426",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0250f7b46aacaef57aadd732",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要变成鲑鱼！\n被风浪无情拍打，然后彻底变强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22a64a7faa1bc8c9ac072e25d269cefceeb24c8b5477571fd55905b4058c0622",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0de8f4c18356c1e6ed71506c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还得更快才行。\n一旦在比赛中受到瞩目，\n苫小牧也能得到热切关注！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3762d9e0997acf4385d634d867c203995e96c7a57f0ec8e04e8d53411a306874",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74cb4c3ac363f55d4cef9fcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好~嘞，今天也要用北寄力量\n好好加油呗~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d6244249a6947478837c7cc849ed623525133d8c9dfcf79ede47b89c250c838",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edeb20338d43f75b134de2bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次度假，\n一定会带来好消息的……\n等着我，大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "884e40e39dd72de5770a416f6e478b2efc8f24e7dcd755f3934d0ffd7422a3ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f91402c4f1985ac68717b95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉肩膀有些放松下来了。\n……不是独自一人的话\n心里就踏实多了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70168d7b576eae6558ed7e19749845f3a2be599deacfe86b59bf4763ec5ebd42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cd5eb2c924d6ba7bab85b45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心胸宽广，温暖地迎接了我……\n训练员就像港湾一样呢。\n是我在特雷森学园的苫小牧港♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e315ebd8d65a5eb3aa95e3662cd3e7ef59c181fdb1050ab744f6c77234cfab0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba4f7addceafd9bc43741e66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "带着训练员和故乡的人们……\n带着大家的愿望奔跑。\n实现了的话…要用笑容迎接我哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a9bb064eda54d7c7a5752bdd338e7958b8b28e6b099cd2f64facbce225dd539",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12d142d7829d854f963f921b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我成功发扬重要的故乡了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f41c5d0209687e0fe4601a388f1c2d434f09ff743c462383f4ca850f31bb0d57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9722e6dbfab95937cf296fcd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我能努力到这个地步……\r\n全都是多亏了你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc57c3de5812815f01a17092550f96b92f559a48c3c93e52da53eab94bdd25da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19b4103569938437694efbb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝贺会要在苫小牧的沙滩上举行，\n约好了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fe9df52127f03237b410c92ba6cdf0505f74129e674115c01510b4ee0b8c1e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42e02c9d674c7232a9794fe9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛跑还有地方偶像……\n都留下了热烈的回忆♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7681119c0913e141be04a7f959e328bac1367767279ea9b79b53ba80e55d3569",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:147fbd6a831c4ac28a5a02ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还会再继续努力下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b86a65c46c8a0aebfc7b170efd88773c7024da2ed35b7f3daaa948430310201b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56ba89af5964ceed06252a88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我身为地方偶像能做到的表现\r\n似乎会变得更丰富呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15e7e187657b12d83801222ccac3594bd75bcc375f6f2b6924d242ae12cd0aa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7850196b44142f4d6e7551e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "北港火山，将会全力以赴呗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bfc9f028db50d75e97edcd9ff0ccad403bcaabbe5c785ab6cd5be7716e12652",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:334411af96539c8d76526885",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最快的地方偶像，从苫小牧降临\r\n此地了呗～☆……很好，就是这样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c41cdf3a5523a26378b864f40692de06eeaebe081e2c1cc9c134767604ddb4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6367cd9804124b9f26809896",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "互相帮助很重要，对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ee12e0dc47b9179d629d92faa0d1061b6ef93e8b2282c2421ae99a313bfd9a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22e4aaf4dec4790bd48066f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能帮上别人的忙……真的很棒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffc2fe7b83b94151f2d376dc7783d5b0c6d030622ace9b2ed0baa8f4eeeb1ce1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64fb0338239c9725fe51d0c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！\n这样就能度过一个美好的夏天了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85ebe14e435c08cd2c0c898d87d9c6ba7c0b59c5abd09f02b0e16c31827d0238",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b16a218baea908c8bb0e4ab1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家的热切视线，\n就让我一个人独占吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "afd2e8404a70843268ca587848eef0040926b653103c58b8b18dea9095af3457",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cde82de7b896794afb660325",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是夏天！是度假！\r\n是苫小牧啊~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b1eadea6fac8754de22f280821dc38b45328564dd82f9f5afdb1abf1dde746c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1099",
        "95009"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
